  "description": "CR 702.182a, 205.1b, 603.2, 120.3a: Black Mage's Rod gives its creature +1/+0, Wizard, and \"whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature deals 1 damage to each opponent\", moving with the Rod",
  "note": "Three seats so \"each opponent\" is both bob and carol and never alice; their lives differ so neither total can stand in for the other. Job select (CR 702.182a) equips the Hero: a 2/1 Wizard Hero. The Rod's own cast is a noncreature spell but precedes the Hero, so it deals nothing. Divination pings both opponents once; the Grizzly Bears is a creature spell and pings nobody. Re-equipped to the Bears, the Rod's grant moves: the Hero is back to a plain 1/1 Hero and the Bears a 3/2 Bear Wizard, and the second Divination pings each opponent once, not twice.",
